{"unit_id":"tag:0945:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n对象（object）<MATH_0001>，属于某个位点（site），是 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>弱可缩（weakly contractible）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>的，若集合（sets）的层（sheaves）的每个满射（surjection）<MATH_0002> 都产生满射（surjection）<MATH_0003>，见《位点（Sites）》定义 <REF_0001>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"weakly contractible","target_term":"弱可缩"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"弱可缩对象"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"对象的基"},{"source_term":"weakly contractible","target_term":"弱可缩","context":"取截面保持满射"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"层的取值"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"定义中的输入"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射","context":"层与截面间的比较"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点","context":"引用章节"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0946:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为位点（site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为弱可缩（weakly contractible）对象（object），属于 <MATH_0003>。则\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 函子（functor）<MATH_0004> 为正合（exact）函子（functor）<MATH_0005>，\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0006> 对每个阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）<MATH_0007> 及所有 <MATH_0008> 成立，且\n<STRUCT_0004> 对任意群（groups）的层（sheaf）<MATH_0009>，任意 <MATH_0010>-挠子（torsor）在 <MATH_0011> 上都有截面（section）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"weakly contractible","target_term":"弱可缩"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"groups","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"torsor","target_term":"挠子"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"系数的基"},{"source_term":"weakly contractible","target_term":"弱可缩","context":"取截面正合的输入"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"取截面的对象"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"取截面"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"弱可缩性的后果"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"高次上同调输入"},{"source_term":"groups","target_term":"群","context":"挠子的结构群"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"结构群层"},{"source_term":"torsor","target_term":"挠子","context":"局部平凡对象"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面","context":"挠子的平凡化"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0946:proof","translation":"第一项立即由定义得出（另见《同调代数（Homology）》第 <REF_0001> 节）。高次（higher）导出函子（derived functors）由《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理 <REF_0002> 消失。设 <MATH_0001> 为 <MATH_0002>-挠子（torsor）。则 <MATH_0003> 是层（sheaves）的满射（surjective）映射（map）。因此，(3) 也由定义得出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调代数"},{"source_term":"higher","target_term":"高次"},{"source_term":"derived functors","target_term":"导出函子"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"torsor","target_term":"挠子"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调代数","context":"引用章节"},{"source_term":"higher","target_term":"高次","context":"导出次数"},{"source_term":"derived functors","target_term":"导出函子","context":"截面函子的高次导出"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"引用章节"},{"source_term":"torsor","target_term":"挠子","context":"非阿贝尔结论的输入"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"挠子的投影"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"挠子投影的性质"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"挠子的投影"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0945:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在这里列出具有足够多的（enough）弱可缩（weakly contractible）对象（objects）的一些后果是方便的。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"enough","target_term":"足够多的"},{"source_term":"weakly contractible","target_term":"弱可缩"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"enough","target_term":"足够多的","context":"弱可缩对象覆盖生成的条件"},{"source_term":"weakly contractible","target_term":"弱可缩","context":"覆盖中的对象性质"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"正合性检验的输入"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0947:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为位点（site）。设 <MATH_0002>，使每个 <MATH_0003> 都弱可缩（weakly contractible），且 <MATH_0004> 的每个对象（object）都有覆盖（covering），由 <MATH_0005> 的元素（elements）组成。设 <MATH_0006> 为 <MATH_0007> 上的环层（sheaf of rings）。则\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 复形（complex）<MATH_0008>，由 <MATH_0009>-模（modules）组成，是正合（exact）的，当且仅当\n<MATH_0010>\n对所有 <MATH_0011> 都正合（exact）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 每个对象（object）<MATH_0012>，属于 <MATH_0013>，都是其典范（canonical）截断（truncations）的导出极限（derived limit）：<MATH_0014>。\n<STRUCT_0004> 给定逆系统（inverse system）\n<MATH_0015>，\n其过渡映射（transition maps）为满射（surjective），则投影（projection）<MATH_0016> 为满射（surjective）。\n<STRUCT_0005> 乘积（Products）在 <MATH_0017> 上正合（exact）。\n<STRUCT_0006> <MATH_0018> 上的乘积（Products）可通过取任意代表复形（complexes）的乘积（products）来计算。\n<STRUCT_0007> 若 <MATH_0019> 为逆系统（inverse system），由 <MATH_0020>-模（modules）组成，则 <MATH_0021> 对所有 <MATH_0022> 成立，且\n<MATH_0023>，\n其中映射（map）为 <MATH_0024>。\n<STRUCT_0008> 若 <MATH_0025> 为逆系统（inverse system），由 <MATH_0026> 的对象（objects）组成，则有短正合列（short exact sequences）\n<MATH_0027>。\n<STRUCT_0009>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"weakly contractible","target_term":"弱可缩"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"sheaf of rings","target_term":"环层"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"truncations","target_term":"截断"},{"source_term":"derived limit","target_term":"导出极限"},{"source_term":"inverse system","target_term":"逆系统"},{"source_term":"transition maps","target_term":"过渡映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"surjective","tar